      "writtenOn": "2026-11-22T14:33:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could the length check allow a name that fits within a longer record? Phosphor-host-ipmid emits fixed-size full records; change 68337 shows a record length of 59 with a 13-byte ID. This check rejects that record. Could we add it as an acceptance case while retaining the bounds checks?",
      "revId": "e10cd8a9242395bcf6387e4143d58768d1f8fd43",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
